Job Description
Roles & Responsibilities
Job Description
As a Data Consultant, you will join a Scrum team and focus on a specific functional area. Your role will be to contribute to data projects by providing your expertise on the following tasks:

Participate in the execution of all business projects;
Handle correction requests arising from incidents or anomalies;
Participate in the self-training and skills development of the development team; Apply best practices and development standards;
Implement DevOps methodologies;
Contribute to usage estimates and release planning;
Contribute to delivery automation
; Develop and document your code;
Work within a Scrum team (Product Owner, Developers, QA, Support).
